world is very important.

00:07:34.059 --> 00:07:37.378
And to layer it into a social
network, what I like about it

00:07:37.378 --> 00:07:40.598
for SnapChat is they're
getting in very early.

00:07:40.598 --> 00:07:43.718
What I mean by very early
is not into the game,

00:07:43.718 --> 00:07:47.708
very early in one's age
to create the behavior.

00:07:47.719 --> 00:07:51.899
Because SnapChat has a heavy
13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19

00:07:51.899 --> 00:07:55.338
year old demo, they can
capture a lot of that behavior.

00:07:55.338 --> 00:07:56.978
I always thought that Facebook,
I remember thinking that

00:07:56.978 --> 00:08:00.278
the social network I wanted
to build when Facebook was

00:08:00.278 --> 00:08:03.508
blowing it up was one that
was around your license.

00:08:03.878 --> 00:08:04.938
Because I wanted to get the people

00:08:04.938 --> 00:08:06.278
before they went to college.

00:08:06.278 --> 00:08:08.278
And I thought like, if we
start a social network where

00:08:08.278 --> 00:08:10.759
your license was your
gateway in, that there was

00:08:10.759 --> 00:08:12.938
something there and that's
what SnapChat has done.

00:08:12.938 --> 00:08:14.378
It's gone earlier.

00:08:14.378 --> 00:08:16.478
It creates behavior.

00:08:16.478 --> 00:08:20.738
Look, cryptocurrency, Apple
Pay, this kind of stuff with

00:08:20.738 --> 00:08:24.818
Square and SnapChat, if I'm a
traditional financial service,

00:08:24.818 --> 00:08:29.078
I'm very concerned about
the enormous innovation over

00:08:29.078 --> 00:08:32.318
the last 24 months invading on my turf.

00:08:32.318 --> 00:08:35.899
And if I'm a consumer, I'm extremely happy

00:08:35.899 --> 00:08:38.738
because competition breeds
enormous innovation.

00:08:38.738 --> 00:08:41.038
And the number one thing we love is time.

00:08:41.038 --> 00:08:43.738
And I see a lot of things
in the financial world

00:08:43.738 --> 00:08:44.639
saving us time now.

00:08:44.639 --> 00:08:47.779
Saving us time to go into
our wallet and take this out,

00:08:47.779 --> 00:08:48.999
and take out cash.

00:08:48.999 --> 00:08:50.499
Ooh, I actually have to
give a receipts to Matt.

00:08:50.499 --> 00:08:52.858
You know, so that's good.

00:08:53.418 --> 00:08:57.298
And you know, or this,
taking out a credit card

00:08:57.298 --> 00:08:59.968
and swiping it takes time.

00:09:00.078 --> 00:09:02.039
All these things are much
quicker in this world.

00:09:02.039 --> 00:09:03.538
Speed, my friends.

00:09:03.538 --> 00:09:06.539
In sports and in business
really matters cause we

00:09:06.539 --> 00:09:08.378
